#Command Briefing

$Stage Text:
 XSTR("$f Strike $f at $f Sullust 

The successful sabotage of an Imperial manufacturing facility near Pinyumb has been a real morale boost for the Sullustan Resistance.

Our contact on the ground has informed us that the Imperials are expecting a shipment of new mining parts which they desperately need to continue production.  

It is imperative that this shipment is disrupted in order to further weaken the Imperial presence on the planet.  Despite that the ISB is on high alert, we have no reason to believe they will be expecting such a bold strike immediately following the local sabotage.", 2922)
$end_multi_text
$Ani Filename: <default>
+Wave Filename: WalkThr_CB_1.ogg

#Briefing
$start_briefing
$num_stages: 4
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("The shipment convoy will consist of three BFF-1 Bulk Freighters.

This convoy is part of an Imperial operation and we will not have the luxury of time to target only the containers.  

Your sole objective is to completely destroy all three BFF-1 Bulk Freighters and retreat.", 2923)
$end_multi_text
$voice: WalkThr_B_1.ogg
