$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("After the initial TIE patrol is dealt with, Gold will have approximately 30secs before the Vigilance can deploy more fighters.  

It will not be long before you are overwhelmed so it is imperative to stick to the objective.  Hit and run!

We cannot afford any casualties, neither for the sake of the pilots nor the morale in the sector.", 2934)
$end_multi_text
$voice: WalkThr_B_4.ogg
