#Debriefing_info

$Num stages: 5

$Formula: ( and 
   ( is-goal-true-delay "Survive" 0 ) 
   ( is-goal-true-delay 
      "BFF-1s Destroyed" 
      0 
   )
   ( is-goal-true-delay 
      "Eliminate the Officers" 
      0 
   )
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("Mission Success!

Excellent work pilots!  This brave hit and run was a risky one but it has been well worth it.  The destruction of the Imperial shipment might only delay production for a matter of days or weeks but it has certainly bolstered the morale of the Sullustan Resistance.

The Empire will certainly feel the embarrassment of losing this equipment right under the nose of the Vigilance.  We can expect increased patrols and further reprisals on Sullust but the success of this bold mission with zero casualties has sent a clear message that we are very capable and well organized.

Well done!", 2935)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: WalkThr_DB_1.ogg
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("Destroying the Lambda Shuttle ferrying Imperial officers from Sullust will strike fear among the higher ranking Imperials stationed there.  Taking out this high value target was a valuable bonus to an already successful operation.", 2936)
$end_multi_text

$Formula: ( and 
   ( is-goal-true-delay "Survive" 0 ) 
   ( is-goal-true-delay 
      "BFF-1s Destroyed" 
      0 
   )
   ( not 
      ( is-goal-true-delay 
         "Eliminate the Officers" 
         0 
      )
   )
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("Mission Success!

Excellent work pilots!  This brave hit and run was a risky one but it has been well worth it.  The destruction of the Imperial shipment might only delay production for a matter of days or weeks but it has certainly bolstered the morale of the Sullustan Resistance.

The Empire will certainly feel the embarrassment of losing this equipment right under the nose of the Vigilance.  We can expect increased patrols and further reprisals on Sullust but the success of this bold mission with zero casualties has sent a clear message that we are very capable and well organized.

Well done!", 2935)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: WalkThr_DB_1.ogg
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("The loss of every TIE pilot is a victory for us.  Unfortunately they are readily replaceable.  If you want to really impress and hit the Empire where it hurts then don't let the Imperial Officers escape.", 2937)
$end_multi_text

$Formula: ( and 
   ( not 
      ( is-goal-true-delay "Survive" 0 ) 
   )
   ( not 
      ( is-goal-true-delay 
         "BFF-1s Destroyed" 
         0 
      )
   )
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("Mission Failed!

The mission was a risky one.  The failed attempt to disrupt the Imperial production on Sullust will render the ground efforts to be no more than a temporary inconvenience to the Empire.  We can expect support for the Sullustan Resistance to fall.

The increased ISB suspicion of the Cobalt Laborers' Reformation Front has caused many within the group to distance themselves from the Sullustan resistance itself.  It might be some time before we can expect to receive any further intel.", 2938)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: WalkThr_DB_2.ogg
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("", -1)
$end_multi_text

$Formula: ( and 
   ( not 
      ( is-goal-true-delay "Survive" 0 ) 
   )
   ( is-goal-true-delay 
      "BFF-1s Destroyed" 
      0 
   )
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("Mission Failed!

The mission was a risky one.  Sadly the losses suffered today will be more than to our pilot ranks.  By destroying the shipment we have successfully delayed Imperial production on Sullust, perhaps for a few days, but the lives of our pilots are worth more than the cost of mining equipment.

The increased ISB suspicion of the Cobalt Laborers' Reformation Front has caused many within the group to distance themselves from the Sullustan Resistance.  It might be some time before we can expect to receive any further intel.

When the new shipment arrives, likely in a few days, we will not stand a chance of intercepting it.  We can only hope that the Sullustan Resistance holds.", 2939)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: WalkThr_DB_3.ogg
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("", -1)
$end_multi_text

$Formula: ( and 
   ( is-goal-true-delay "Survive" 0 ) 
   ( not 
      ( is-goal-true-delay 
         "BFF-1s Destroyed" 
         0 
      )
   )
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("Mission Failed!

The mission was a risky one.  The failed attempt to disrupt the Imperial production on Sullust will render the ground efforts to be no more than a temporary inconvenience to the Empire.  We can expect support for the Sullustan Resistance to fall.

